00:17:03,390 --> 00:17:15,790
Speaker 1: Yet not the wisdom of this world, nor of the princes of this world that come to naught, he says, but we speak the wisdom of God in a mystery, even the hidden wisdom.

216
00:17:16,030 --> 00:17:24,470
Speaker 1: Listen, I know that you are literally miles, thousands of miles apart, but just say hidden wisdom now.

217
00:17:24,470 --> 00:17:29,230
Speaker 1: So there is a type of wisdom that the Bible calls hidden wisdom.

218
00:17:29,630 --> 00:17:33,920
Speaker 1: It says, which God ordained before the world unto our glory.

