00:18:52,490 --> 00:18:54,090
Speaker 1: Reveal them all to us by the Spirit.

238
00:18:54,090 --> 00:18:56,370
Speaker 1: For the Spirit searcheth all things, yea, the deep things of God.

239
00:18:56,540 --> 00:19:04,300
Speaker 1: Remember what we read in Ephesians chapter three, where Paul said that God made unto him how?

240
00:19:04,300 --> 00:19:07,180
Speaker 1: That by revelation he made unto him the mysteries.

241
00:19:07,580 --> 00:19:08,060
Speaker 1: All right.

242
00:19:08,060 --> 00:19:09,580
Speaker 1: So mysteries were revealed to Paul.

