00:19:09,740 --> 00:19:11,340
Speaker 1: Paul revealed them to us.

244
00:19:11,420 --> 00:19:14,620
Speaker 1: He wrote them in a way that we could easily read and understand.

245
00:19:15,420 --> 00:19:25,430
Speaker 1: This is how Bible revelation has been demystified, revealed to Paul and all the other prophets and apostles.

246
00:19:25,750 --> 00:19:31,830
Speaker 1: They wrote about it in clear terms and then we could read and understand.

247
00:19:31,910 --> 00:19:33,510
Speaker 1: That's how revelation got to us.

248
00:19:33,910 --> 00:19:44,150
Speaker 1: And so when we read the writings of the apostles in the epistles, it became clear what God had ordained in the Scriptures.

249
00:19:44,390 --> 00:19:48,390
Speaker 1: Because the New Testament are both a commentary of the Old Testament.

250
00:19:48,390 --> 00:19:49,430
Speaker 1: Do you get what I'm saying?

251
00:19:49,910 --> 00:19:50,950
Speaker 1: Think about it this way.

252
